# The installsysusers dh addon ships in debhelper itself and is enabled
# via `dh $@ --with installsysusers` because auto-sequencing of
# dh_installsysusers only starts at compat 14. debhelper-compat (= 13)
# pulls debhelper, which provides the addon, so an explicit
# libdebhelper-perl build-dependency is redundant.
ethercat source: missing-build-dependency-for-dh-addon installsysusers *
